Package: pontept
Title: PONTE-O: Portuguese Obesity Trajectories and Economic Microsimulation
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person(given = "Berta",
           family = "Valente",
           email = "berta.valente@ispup.up.pt",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides Module 1 of PONTE-O, a person-level open-cohort
    microsimulation model of historical and projected adult body mass index
    (BMI), obesity, mortality, ageing, and age-20 population entrants in
    Portugal. Modules 2 and 3 estimate long-term health and economic
    outcomes from simulated obesity trajectories.
